---
// nmajor.com/subscribe: signup page for Deploy to Humans, Nick's weekly newsletter.
// The newsletter is getting its own site at deploytohumans.com; until that is live
// this page is its home. Form posts to /api/subscribe (see SubscribeForm.astro).
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SubscribeForm from '../components/SubscribeForm.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Deploy to Humans · a weekly newsletter by Nick Major"
  description="Deploy to Humans is Nick Major's weekly newsletter for developers learning distribution: one marketing or growth experiment, what happened, and the tools he used. Free."
  ogImage="/og/subscribe.png"
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="card shero">
      <span class="eyebrow">The newsletter</span>
      <h1 class="shero__h1">Deploy to <span>Humans</span></h1>
      <p class="shero__lede">Shipping is easy. Deploying to humans is the hard part. Every week I send one marketing or growth experiment I ran on my own products, what happened, and the tools I used. Free.</p>
      <SubscribeForm id="form-top" source="subscribe_page" theme="dark" button="Subscribe" />
      <p class="shero__micro">One email a week. Unsubscribe in one click.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="sgrid">
      <div class="card sbox" style="background: var(--yellow)">
        <h2>What you get</h2>
        <p>A real experiment each week: SEO, cold outreach, launches, social, automation. What I tried, the numbers, and whether I'd do it again. Failures included, since those teach more.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card sbox" style="background: var(--mint)">
        <h2>Who it's for</h2>
        <p>Indie hackers and developers who are more comfortable building than marketing. If you've shipped something good and watched nobody show up, it's for you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card sbox" style="background: var(--blue)">
        <h2>Who's writing</h2>
        <p>Me, Nick. About fifteen years building software. Now I'm learning distribution in public and taking notes as I go. <a href="/about/">More about me</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card sbox" style="background: var(--pink)">
        <h2>The fine print</h2>
        <p>Free, no paid tier. If I recommend a tool, I'll say whether I have any stake in it. Replies come straight to my inbox, and I read them.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <style>
    .shero { margin-top: clamp(20px, 4vw, 40px); background: var(--ink); color: #fff; padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 52px); }
    .shero__h1 { margin: 16px 0 0; font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(46px, 8vw, 84px); line-height: .98; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
    .shero__h1 span { color: var(--yellow); }
    .shero__lede { margin: 18px 0 0; max-width: 60ch; font-size: clamp(17px, 1.9vw, 20px); color: #d8d2c8; }
    .shero__micro { margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #a29b90; }
    .sgrid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 18px; margin-top: 28px; }
    .sbox { padding: 24px; }
    .sbox h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--display); font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .sbox p { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 16px; }
    .sbox a { font-weight: 600; }
    @media (max-width: 760px) { .sgrid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  </style>
</Base>
